+
+## Plugin presentation compatibility
+
+`bb.experimental_p6rRoutes?.p6rThreadPath` uses the host's canonical project or
+personal thread path. The optional second HTTP handler argument contains only
+`experimental_p6rExternalOrigin`: configured `BB_APP_URL` origin, or direct
+request origin when configuration is absent. It carries no principal or actor.
+Never treat the fallback origin or forwarded headers as authority. Test both
+configured enhanced links and older hosts that omit these optional extensions.
+
+`PluginSidebarThread.p6rParticipants` and `P6rParticipantProfile` expose the
+host's persisted participant key/display/image projection. The thread list
+loads these in one batch; plugin rows do not query a directory. Mention targets
+and admitted contribution authors can be participants without being the current
+viewer or a claimed message author. Audit canonical source and mapper retention
+when changing the thread-list contract.
